Package: pg-strom-pg@@PG_MAJORVERSION@@
Maintainer: KaiGai Kohei <kaigai@heterodb.com>
Architecture: @@DEB_ARCH@@
Version: @@PGSTROM_VERSION@@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Depends: postgresql-@@PG_MAJORVERSION@@, libvulkan1, libarrow@@ARROW_MAJOR@@00, libparquet@@PARQUET_MAJOR@@00, libnuma1
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: PG-Strom - extension for GPU acceleration in PostgreSQL database
 GPU offload of scan, join and aggregation through Vulkan compute (Vulkan
 build, experimental; validated on Apple Silicon only), and an Apache Arrow
 and Parquet foreign data wrapper. The GPU service is installed as
 pgstrom-gpuserv in the PostgreSQL package library directory; it needs a
 Vulkan driver (for example mesa-vulkan-drivers). No CUDA is used.
